# Defensive: stray debug pages under public/ ship in non-Docker
# production builds (Vite bundles anything in `public/` into `dist/client/`).
# The CI guard in .github/workflows/ci.yml is the durable backstop;
# this entry is just a courtesy to keep `git add .` from re-introducing
# them. See issue #169.
public/test-*.html
